markdown <<MARKDOWN
<h1>Pixels of Me Project Overview</h1>
<img src="https://images.code.org/66f86ca5d8e42abfe1a34e51af2ea606-image-1741790839525.png" alt="Mario made out of pixels" width="170px" style="border-radius:10px; float:left; margin: 0px 20px 10px 0px;">
<br><br>
<p>In this project, students will create a digital pixel artifact that represents an aspect of their identity, such as a hobby, interest, future career, or favorite book or movie.</p>
<p>They will apply computational thinking, Python programming, and AI tools to develop their designs while engaging in peer feedback and reflection.</p>
<div style="clear:both;"></div>

<h2>Project Requirements:</h2>

<details style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; color: #1F1976; font-size: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; flex-shrink:0;">1</span>Computational Thinking</summary>
<div style="margin-top: 12px; margin-left: 36px;">
<p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;">• Break down their design into smaller components (decomposition).</p>
<p style="margin: 0;">• Identify patterns and simplify code using abstraction.</p>
</div>
</details>

<details style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; color: #1F1976; font-size: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; flex-shrink:0;">2</span>Algorithms & Python</summary>
<div style="margin-top: 12px; margin-left: 36px;">
<p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;">• Use sequencing, loops, and selection statements to structure their code.</p>
<p style="margin: 0;">• Implement functions with descriptive names for clarity.</p>
</div>
</details>

<details style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; color: #1F1976; font-size: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; flex-shrink:0;">3</span>Code Documentation</summary>
<div style="margin-top: 12px; margin-left: 36px;">
<p style="margin: 0;">• Add comments to explain the purpose of key functions and code segments.</p>
</div>
</details>

<details style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; color: #1F1976; font-size: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; flex-shrink:0;">4</span>Feedback & Reflection</summary>
<div style="margin-top: 12px; margin-left: 36px;">
<p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;">• Participate in a TAG Method peer review to refine their work.</p>
<p style="margin: 0;">• Reflect on their computational thinking process and problem-solving strategies.</p>
</div>
</details>

<details style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border: 1px solid #E4E2F8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; color: #1F1976; font-size: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14px; flex-shrink:0;">5</span>AI Integration</summary>
<div style="margin-top: 12px; margin-left: 36px;">
<p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;">• Use AI tools for brainstorming, debugging, or refining their code.</p>
<p style="margin: 0;">• Reflect on AI's role in their project and discuss its ethical implications.</p>
</div>
</details>

<p>This project allows students to apply their coding skills creatively while practicing structured problem solving, peer collaboration, and responsible AI use.</p>
MARKDOWN
